The first of four solutions to a Monthly problem asking if there exist finite sequences 1 < a(1) < a(2) < ... < a(n) such that Sum_i 1/a(i) = 1 and gcd(a(i), a(i+1)) = 1 for 1 <= i < n.

The 8 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

